  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 407.01 Basis for Impact Classification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 407.01 Basis for Impact Classification. Unless otherwise specified in this part or in Env-Wt 408, a project shall be classified as a minimum impact, minor impact, or major impact project based on:\n\n(a) The type of jurisdictional area proposed to be impacted by the project;\n\n(b) The size of the proposed impact on jurisdictional areas; or\n\n(c) A combination of (a) and (b), above.\n\nSource. #12804, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt400.html"
}
